     "content": "\u010a\u010aFINALACTIONS:\u0120pick(mug2)\u0120place(mug2,\u0120table_right_area)\u0120open(box_lid)\u0120pick(mug2)\u0120place(mug2,\u0120inside_box)\u0120pick(mug1)\u0120place(mug1,\u0120inside_box)\u0120pick(mug3)\u0120place(mug3,\u0120inside_box)\u0120pick(spam)\u0120place(spam,\u0120cupboard_shelf)\u0120pick(sugar)\u0120place(sugar,\u0120cupboard_shelf)",
